a9e3fc82509e3e973782243951194dc4b61bf0bdcb82583b7d9fa","heading":null,"ordinal":3,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.400:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.400:block:3","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.400","text":"(d) If the accused person refuses to plead, the court shall enter a plea of not guilty.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"3fddd76b-d840-5ddf-b5ad-2a0feb5bf149"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.400","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.400","content_hash":"1d1b01c86dfaf2443d71296bf90469759c47c4488b33291f05424fbed8fd03c3","heading":null,"ordinal":4,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.400:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.400:block:4","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.400","text":"(e) If the accused person fails to appear, the court shall declare the appearance bond to be forfeited and may issue a warrant for the arrest of the accused person. (Ord. 20206 § 9, 9-10-19; Ord. 17666 § 42, 3-27-01. Code 1995 § 50-77. Formerly 2.110.400.)","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"d83cd37a-9d52-5d65-82d2-7449ee6a6ceb"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"2.40.400","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.400","content_hash":"ea67aae8efab598835352495a8c357f944628b83893932cfe6553b193b5eddf5","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.400:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:2.40.400:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/2.40.400","text":"State Law References: Similar State statute, K.S.A. 12-4406 .","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"e7519797-354e-5a84-8ce4-b958a1b